							"content:wysiwyg_basic:4:19": {
								"icon": "outdent",
								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/8581cb12-90a0-4d4a-aadf-d820fc217297_3.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>Angel Tree: </strong></span>Angel Tree is a program designed to help provide Christmas assistance to children ages birth to 12.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Online Registration Opens in September.</span></font>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tUpon completion and approval of the application, families will be emailed their toy distribution appointment time. Families must come at their appointed time or forfeit all items.  Additionally, Those applying with other agencies will be removed from The Salvation Army’s registration.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>",
								"content": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/8581cb12-90a0-4d4a-aadf-d820fc217297_3.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>Angel Tree: </strong></span>Angel Tree is a program designed to help provide Christmas assistance to children ages birth to 12.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Online Registration Opens in September.</span></font>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tUpon completion and approval of the application, families will be emailed their toy distribution appointment time. Families must come at their appointed time or forfeit all items.  Additionally, Those applying with other agencies will be removed from The Salvation Army’s registration.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>",
