								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e94f0f47-ae74-4090-8a13-6b07cc2c4105_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;\" class=\"text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5\">\n            <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;\">\n                <div style=\"width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;\">\n                    <h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">Information Required:</h5>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t<strong>Information required to register a child 12-years of age or younger for the Angel Tree:</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\tParent or legal guardians photo ID<br>\n\tProof of current address (utility bill, lease, etc.)<br>\n\tProof of all household income (including food stamps)<br>\n\tBirth certificate or Medicaid card for 12 and under\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\tClothing/shoe Sizes and toy suggestions (not to exceed $50.00)\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t <strong>Information required to register a senior 65 years of age or older:</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\tPhoto ID<br>\n\tProof of current address (utility bill, lease, etc.)<br>\n\tProof of all household income (including food stamps)<br>\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t<strong>For Questions:</strong><br>\n\tPlease call <a href=\"tel:504-899-4569&nbsp;\" target=\"\"><span style=\"color:#f5f5f5;\"></span><span style=\"color:#dfdce3;\">(504) 899-4569</span><span style=\"color:#f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</span></a>\n</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>",
