							"content:wysiwyg_basic:9:13": {
								"icon": "outdent",
								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ea51ef07-0ec7-4ee4-ad59-706964ddaf2a_5.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">Help Spread Holiday Cheer!</h5>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tThe Salvation Army Needs volunteers throughout the Christmas Season. Volunteers must be 18 years of age or above unless accompanied by a parent or guardian. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>This is also a great way for students to complete their service hours for school!</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tVolunteer opportunities include: \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Adopting angels:</strong> this is an indoor volunteer opportunity to register donors who adopt an angel from our Angel Tree. Volunteers also collect toys and other gift donations for adopted angels. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Red Kettle Bell Ringer: </strong>the iconic sound of a bell ringing indicates a Salvation Army Red Kettle is nearby. Volunteers are needed daily to have fun, enjoy the season and ring a bell for Red Kettle donations. The funds are used to help purchase gifts for those in our community and to meet other needs.   \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Toy and gift preparation and distribution:</strong> donations for all our angles need to be packaged and prepared for distribution to the hundreds of families who will be able to enjoy a brighter Christmas. Volunteers are needed to help package and distribute gifts and toys (all tasks are done at one location)  \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tBeginning in November, if you wish to help by volunteering, you can pick a location and time to help by going to <a href=\"https://www.registertoring.com/\" target=\"\">Register 2 Ring</a> or emailing <a href=\"mailto:marion.durham@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">marion.durham@uss.salvationarmy.org</a><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>",
								"content": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ea51ef07-0ec7-4ee4-ad59-706964ddaf2a_5.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">Help Spread Holiday Cheer!</h5>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tThe Salvation Army Needs volunteers throughout the Christmas Season. Volunteers must be 18 years of age or above unless accompanied by a parent or guardian. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>This is also a great way for students to complete their service hours for school!</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tVolunteer opportunities include: \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Adopting angels:</strong> this is an indoor volunteer opportunity to register donors who adopt an angel from our Angel Tree. Volunteers also collect toys and other gift donations for adopted angels. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Red Kettle Bell Ringer: </strong>the iconic sound of a bell ringing indicates a Salvation Army Red Kettle is nearby. Volunteers are needed daily to have fun, enjoy the season and ring a bell for Red Kettle donations. The funds are used to help purchase gifts for those in our community and to meet other needs.   \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Toy and gift preparation and distribution:</strong> donations for all our angles need to be packaged and prepared for distribution to the hundreds of families who will be able to enjoy a brighter Christmas. Volunteers are needed to help package and distribute gifts and toys (all tasks are done at one location)  \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tBeginning in November, if you wish to help by volunteering, you can pick a location and time to help by going to <a href=\"https://www.registertoring.com/\" target=\"\">Register 2 Ring</a> or emailing <a href=\"mailto:marion.durham@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">marion.durham@uss.salvationarmy.org</a><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>",
